Package: polkit-kde-agent-1
Version: @DEB_POLKITKDEAGENT1_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: KDE
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://invent.kde.org/plasma/polkit-kde-agent-1
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative, polkit-qt6-1, libpolkit-gobject-1-0, libpolkit-agent-1-0, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-crash, kf6-dbusaddons, kf6-i18n, kf6-kirigami, kf6-windowsystem
Description: PolicyKit authentication dialog for Xios
 The KDE PolicyKit authentication agent registers a listener on
 org.freedesktop.PolicyKit1.AuthenticationAgent and shows the Plasma authentication
 dialog. It is a client of polkitd on the DBus system bus; this platform ships the
 polkit client libraries only, so the agent has no authority to register with yet.
